{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/0d56bf36b4c58e5055a51cb48fb4003e.poster.avif?t=1768177816\" width=600 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/0d56bf36b4c58e5055a51cb48fb4003e.webm?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/0d56bf36b4c58e5055a51cb48fb4003e.mp4?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your towers have friendly fire</strong>, so you must balance offense while still collecting coins that disappear when the round ends. This forces an active playstyle \u2014 you can\u2019t just sit back and relax while thinking about anime girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/dc009d4b701279258a4b033c5a1e4db6.poster.avif?t=1768177816\" width=604 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/dc009d4b701279258a4b033c5a1e4db6.webm?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/dc009d4b701279258a4b033c5a1e4db6.mp4?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all tower upgrades work with each other. Want projectiles that home to a target? Maybe scale projectiles to add more value.\u00a0<strong>Turret placement</strong> is vital, place your turret in valuable position unless you want to die before the first boss.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/e58ce483a4eba357c26be665522b9cc8.poster.avif?t=1768177816\" width=606 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/e58ce483a4eba357c26be665522b9cc8.webm?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/e58ce483a4eba357c26be665522b9cc8.mp4?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tower has a pool of upgrades it randomly draws from, making every playthrough different! Adapt and form new strategies on the fly \u2014 you can\u2019t rely on the same approach every round. Shape your strategy by buying certain upgrades that block potentially unwanted ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/4761e05a1dfc1c6d80555c0e562b0b0a.poster.avif?t=1768177816\" width=608 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/4761e05a1dfc1c6d80555c0e562b0b0a.webm?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/4761e05a1dfc1c6d80555c0e562b0b0a.mp4?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies have different effect! play around them and stay alert.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint Trail - Leaves a trail that speeds up enemies behind them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Effect - On death make enemies close by stop following the path and go towards the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Effect - On death create an explosion that slows the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773930?t=1768177816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773930?t=1768177816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/938f65ad98520752f26cb5e5950a5a719f3d65c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768177816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/938f65ad98520752f26cb5e5950a5a719f3d65c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768177816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/0d56bf36b4c58e5055a51cb48fb4003e.poster.avif?t=1768177816\" width=600 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/0d56bf36b4c58e5055a51cb48fb4003e.webm?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773930/extras/0d56bf36b4c58e5055a51cb48fb4003e.mp4?t=1768177816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your towers have friendly fire</strong>, so you must balance offense while still collecting coins that disappear when the round ends. This forces an 